<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Build with Mau — 3D Scroll-Driven Web Prompts</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-main: #0e1117;
      --bg-card: #151922;
      --bg-input: #1c2333;
      --border: #2b3245;
      --accent-red: #ff4500;
      --accent-orange: #f56565;
      --text-primary: #f0f4f8;
      --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
      --code-bg: #0b0d13;
      --green-neon: #00ff66;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Header Profile Section */
    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .profile-img {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 3px solid var(--accent-red);
    }

    .header-text h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4500, #ff8c00);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .header-text p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    /* Global Info Banner */
    .info-banner {
      background: rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-red);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .info-banner h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--accent-orange);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .password-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent-red);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* Grid Layout */
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* Prompt Cards */
    .card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--accent-red);
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .card-link {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent-orange);
      text-decoration: none;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .card-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .prompt-box {
      background: var(--code-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #a6accd;
      height: 180px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
    }

    .btn-copy {
      background: var(--accent-red);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn-copy:hover {
      background: #e03d00;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 4rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Profile Header -->
    <header>
      <img src="WhatsApp Image 2026-09-21 at 1.36.02 PM.jpeg" alt="Build with Mau" class="profile-img">
      <div class="header-text">
        <h1>BUILD WITH MAU</h1>
        <p>3D Scroll-Driven Interactive Website Prompt Vault for Replit Design</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Info Banner -->
    <div class="info-banner">
      <h2>💡 How to Use These Prompts</h2>
      <p>These prompts serve as a <strong>foundational base</strong> to generate cinema-grade 3D scroll-driven experiences in Replit Agent / Replit Design. You can freely modify the brand names, object types, colors, and frame counts to fit your own project requirements.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">🔒 Live Demo Access Password: <span class="password-badge">scrollingwebsites</span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Prompts Grid -->
    <div class="grid">

      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">01. SMASH CLUB</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app/burger-anatomy/" target="_blank" class="card-link">unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app/burger-anatomy/</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p1">Generate a high-end, scroll-driven interactive website for a late-night burger brand called 'SMASH CLUB'. The design should feature a moody, deep red gradient background with a subtle technical grid overlay. In the center, place a high-resolution double cheeseburger. Use bold, brutalist typography with a massive headline that says 'BUILT LOUD.', highlighting the word 'LOUD.' in vibrant neon green. Include small HUD-like text details such as 'A STUDY IN APPETITE', 'EST. AFTER DARK / OAKLAND, CA', and a 'SCROLL TO BEGIN' trigger at the bottom. Add a text saying 'Scroll through the heat. Every frame is a reason to stay late.' The entire experience must be built around smooth, cinematic scroll animations.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p1')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">02. Couture Unraveled</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app" target="_blank" class="card-link">unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p2">Build an ultra-luxury, high-fashion interactive website for 'Couture Unraveled'. The interface should feature a moody, dark studio backdrop with a white satin gown centered on a mannequin. Use elegant, editorial serif typography for the main title 'Couture unraveled.'. Include minimal HUD technical overlay texts: 'ASTER VALE / 04-24' and 'LOOK 17 / MAIN FILM / 001 - 240' in the top left, 'INDEX' in the top right, and 'A study in separation / 240 frames' above the main headline. At the bottom left, add the text 'Scroll through the assembly. Every frame is a decision.', and a minimal 'SCROLL TO BEGIN' trigger on the bottom right. The core interaction must be a smooth 240-frame scroll-driven animation dissecting the dress assembly.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p2')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">03. Movement in Time</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app/movement-in-time/" target="_blank" class="card-link">unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app/movement-in-time/</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p3">Create a minimalist, premium editorial interactive landing page called 'Movement in Time' for an independent Swiss watchmaking project. The design should feature a central, top-down macro angled shot of a vintage gold watch on a dark, textured background. Include precise metadata text elements with classic serif and clean sans-serif fonts: top left, 'M / 1848'; top center, 'A STUDY IN TIME / THREE FILMS'; top right, 'INDEX ↓'. Next to the large, elegant title 'Movement in time.', add technical labels like 'INDEPENDENT SWISS WATCHMAKING · 120 FRAMES' and 'MAIN FILM / 009 - 120'. At the bottom left, include a body section with the label '01 / THE INHERITANCE', sub-heading 'A quiet object, first.', and the exact body paragraph: 'A watch is not worn. It is inherited. Scroll slowly to look closer. Built to outlast the hand that winds it. A watch is not worn.' Design this as a 120-frame scroll-driven experience where scrolling reveals the intricate mechanics of the watch case in cinematic detail.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p3')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">04. Silicon Anatomy</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app/silicon-anatomy/" target="_blank" class="card-link">unraveling-web-experiences.replit.app/silicon-anatomy/</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p4">Build a dark, technical interactive landing page called 'Silicon Anatomy' showcasing a high-end custom desktop PC build. The interface should have a dark slate gray background centered around a sleek PC tower with a glass side panel revealing internal hardware components. Use bold, modern sans-serif typography for the main title 'See the inside.', highlighting the word 'inside.' in vibrant cyan/teal. Add precise HUD technical labels: top left, 'FIELD GUIDE / 003'; top right, 'THREE FILMS / ONE MACHINE'; above the title, 'MAIN ANATOMY / 001 - 240' and 'SCROLL TO SEPARATE / 240 FRAMES'. In the lower left, include section label '01 / ENCLOSURE', subtitle 'The boundary, before the answer.', and paragraph 'A desktop is not a box. It is a stack of decisions, layered into one quiet machine.'. In the bottom right, add a technical scrubbing control box with 'SCRUB POSITION' and a percentage counter. The interaction must be a 240-frame scroll-driven animation dissecting the PC case and components.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p4')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">05. THE ARTIFACT</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://luxury-rug-scroll-film.replit.app/" target="_blank" class="card-link">luxury-rug-scroll-film.replit.app/</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p5">Build an ultra-luxury artisan interactive landing page titled 'THE ARTIFACT' showcasing high-end hand-woven textile craftsmanship. The interface features a cinematic background of an intricate red, blue, and oxblood medallion rug hanging inside a moody, warmly lit weaving workshop with a traditional wooden loom. Place a massive, elegant serif headline 'THE ARTIFACT' in the center, with a tracked sans-serif subtitle below reading 'DECONSTRUCTING THE OXBLOOD MEDALLION'. Include precise technical HUD labels: top left 'FILM A - 001 / 120', top right 'KHOTAN ATELIER' and 'ARCHIVE // 2026', and bottom right 'SCROLL TO DISCOVER' with a cursor indicator icon. Structure the core interaction as a 120-frame scroll-driven film that zooms into the weave, knotwork, and individual threads as the user scrolls.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p5')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">06. GRAIN</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://grain-bench-scroll-film.replit.app" target="_blank" class="card-link">grain-bench-scroll-film.replit.app</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p6">Build an ultra-luxury architectural furniture design landing page titled 'GRAIN'. The interface features a clean, minimalist studio backdrop showcasing a custom handcrafted walnut wood bench with brass legs and a striking fan-like array of wooden slats topped with brass spheres radiating behind it. Use a large, elegant serif font for the main title 'GRAIN'. Above the title, place a small gold subtitle reading 'BENCH NO. 01 — WALNUT & BRASS'. Directly beneath the headline, include the paragraph 'One unbroken shot, from inside the wood to the finished bench. Scroll.', followed by a subtle 'SCROLL TO DISCOVER ↓' CTA. In the bottom right corner, add minimal metadata labels 'ACT I — WITHIN' and '001 - 480'. Design the experience as a 480-frame scroll-driven film taking the user on a single unbroken visual journey from raw timber to the completed piece.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p6')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 7 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">07. CIRRO</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://cashmere-scroll-film.replit.app/" target="_blank" class="card-link">cashmere-scroll-film.replit.app/</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p7">Build an ultra-luxury knitwear landing page titled 'CIRRO'. The interface features a warm, moody studio aesthetic with dramatic side lighting hitting a premium white cashmere turtleneck sweater on a mannequin against a rustic dark stone wall background. Use a refined serif font for the centered main headline 'CIRRO', with a subtle spaced sans-serif subtitle underneath reading 'THE ANATOMY THROUGH LIGHT'. On the left edge, include vertical technical HUD labels reading 'ACT I' near the top and '001 - 120' near the bottom. Structure the core interaction as a 120-frame scroll-driven film that seamlessly explores the fabric texture, cashmere weave, and light play as the user scrolls down.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p7')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 8 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <span class="card-title">08. Mercedes-AMG GT</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://amg-gt-scroll-film.replit.app" target="_blank" class="card-link">amg-gt-scroll-film.replit.app</a>
          <div class="prompt-box" id="p8">Build a high-end automotive interactive landing page titled 'GT' for the Mercedes-AMG GT. The interface features a dark, cinematic studio backdrop with a silver Mercedes-AMG GT sports car emerging from the shadows, illuminated by soft overhead lighting with reflections on a wet glossy floor. Centered over the car, place a small uppercase subtitle 'MERCEDES - AMG' above a massive, serif headline reading 'GT'. Below the headline, include an italicized subtitle 'One unbroken shot — from skin to crankshaft and back', followed by the interactive CTA 'SCROLL TO DRIVE THE CAMERA'. In the bottom left corner, add the HUD text 'THE STAGE', and in the bottom right corner, add the frame counter '001 - 480'. Structure the experience as a 480-frame scroll-driven camera journey around and inside the vehicle.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyPrompt('p8')">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
      <p>© Build with Mau — Created for Replit Design & Web Developers</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    function copyPrompt(id) {
      const text = document.getElementById(id).innerText;
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
        alert("Prompt copied to clipboard!");
      });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
